      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3652249980948
    m_Localized: Equip all curses first
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3652249980949
    m_Localized: '<b>Unlock</b>

      Equip {0}+ curses and get {1} kills in one
      run'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3652249980950
    m_Localized: '<b>Unlock</b>

      Unlock the previous curse first.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3652249980951
    m_Localized: '<b>Unlock</b>

      Only one who bears every curse is worthy.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3652249980952
    m_Localized: Stickers {0} / {1}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3652249980953
    m_Localized: Not unlocked yet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3652249980954
    m_Localized: Unlocked
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3652249980955
    m_Localized: 'Reset your save?

      All achievements, unlocks and records will
      be lost.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3652249980956
    m_Localized: 'Are you really sure?

      This cannot be undone!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3652249980957
    m_Localized: 'Shakes the screen on explosions and hits.

      Turn it off if
      it makes you dizzy.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3652249980958
    m_Localized: 'Softens explosion flashes, screen flashes and blinking.

      Turn
      it on if you are sensitive to light.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3652249980959
    m_Localized: 'Pauses automatically when you click outside

      the game or
      switch to another window.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3652249980960
    m_Localized: 'Sends anonymous play data such as run results and gear.

      No
      personal information is sent.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3652249980961
    m_Localized: Switches between fullscreen and windowed mode.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3652249980962
    m_Localized: 'Changes the game window size.

      Only 16:9 is offered so the
      layout stays intact.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
