  - m_Id: 3652249980972
    m_Localized: Unlocks as you progress through the story.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3652249980973
    m_Localized: About Play Data
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3652249980974
    m_Localized: 'To make the game better, we would like to collect anonymous play
      data (run results, chosen gear, progress) and basic device info.

      We
      never collect personal information such as your name or contact details, and
      you can turn this off anytime in Settings.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
